{
  "id": 4,
  "description": "## 🔥 **[Y]ggdrasil [o]f [U]niverse** 🔥\n**Ancient, wise, always strong. He who follows lives long.**\n\n### 🎉 **Since August 8th, 2024 – 1st Guild to Reach Level 100!** 🎉\n**A guild for experienced and high-level players.**\n\n### ✅ **Join Requirements**\n- Active player\n- Discord required\n- Combat Level 100+ / Total Level 1000+\n\n### 🚫 **Kick Conditions**\n- Inactive in-game for 7 days without notifying a leader\n- Not in the Guild Discord\n\n### ⌚ **Raid Schedule**\n**Every Sunday** – 3 Raids back-to-back at **11:00 AM UTC**, except during an active event.\n\n### 🏊 **Pool Schedule**\n- **Weekday Pool (Monday–Saturday):** 1 pool daily at **9 Am UTC**; activated an hour earlier when there is an upcoming assault.\n- **Event Weeks:** 2 pools daily at **3:30 AM UTC** and **3:30 PM UTC**\n\n### ⚔️ **Assault Schedule**\n- Usually at around **9 AM UTC**, but the exact timing and frequency may vary depending on the assault and the current situation.\n\n### 🎁 **Guild Benefits**\n- Extensive private data resources on everything, especially combat and dungeons\n- Giveaways\n- Discord server tag\n- Twice-daily pools\n- Raid is not mandatory\n- Shooting Star &amp; World Boss pings\n- In-depth gameplay guides\n- In-game guild tag\n- Free teleport to Citadel\n- ...and more!\n\n### ❗ **Join the Strongest Guilds Today!**\n- Contact a **Deputy** or **Officer** on Discord to join.\n- **Applications – Status Varies (Not strictly open or closed)**\n- You can also apply to our sister guild, **You Rising**. **We are looking for members.**\n\n### 🌐 **discord.gg/98ETEFznCX**\n**Founded March 6th, 2024**",
